  "problem": "If $p(x)=-3{x}^{5}$ and $q(x)=\\frac{4}{{x}^{7}}$, then\n\n${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }({x}^{2}\\cdot p(x)\\cdot q(x))=$\n{{field-1}}.",
